@startuml
' NewEra POS - State diagram of a cashier session (DR-09, UC4), W11
' Team D - editable source of assets/state_cashier_session.png
' Render with: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng -charset UTF-8 assets/state_cashier_session.puml
' Sources: SRS UC4, FR-47, FR-60 to FR-63, FR-74, FR-75, DR-09, BR-17, contracts 16 to 21 and 29, AD-05.

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam StateBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EAF1FB
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8A04A
skinparam StateStartColor #444444
skinparam StateEndColor #444444

title NewEra POS - State diagram: life of a cashier session

state "Open" as Open
state "Closing" as Closing {
  state "Counting\n(drawer open)" as Counting
  state "Difference shown" as Shown
  [*] --> Counting
  Counting --> Shown : enterClosingCash(amount)\nvalid amount (FR-61, FR-62)
  Counting --> Counting : invalid amount (UC4 ext. 3a)
}
state "Closed" as Closed
state "Closed, to review" as ToReview
state "Reviewed" as Reviewed
state "Interrupted" as Interrupted

[*] --> Open : logIn(employeeID, pin) and\nenterOpeningCash(amount)\n(UC4 steps 6-9, FR-47)
Open --> Open : closeSession() refused while a sale,\nreturn, rental or rental return\nis open (FR-60, UC4 ext. 2a)
Open --> Closing : closeSession()\n(FR-60)
Shown --> Closed : confirmCloseSession(),\ndifference up to 5.00 (BR-17)\nend time recorded (FR-63)
Shown --> ToReview : confirmCloseSession(),\ndifference larger than 5.00,\nplus or minus (FR-74, BR-17)
ToReview --> Reviewed : confirmSessionReview(managerID,\npin, reason) (FR-75, Contract 29)\nneeds the store database
Open --> Interrupted : failure; found at the next startUp():\nend time = time of the start-up, no\nclosing cash (FR-63, Contract 16)
Closing --> Interrupted : failure; as above
Closed --> [*]
Reviewed --> [*]
Interrupted --> [*]

note right of Open
  Every transaction refers to exactly one
  cashier session (DR-09).
end note

note bottom of ToReview
  The session is in the list of sessions to review of every
  store manager. The review (reviewer, time, reason) is written in the
  store database and copied back to the register (AD-05).
end note

note bottom of Interrupted
  An interrupted session is not to review: it has no closing cash
  and no difference. Open transactions are recovered at the same
  start-up (IR-15).
end note

note left of Closed
  The register sends the session to the store database when
  it opens and again when it ends (record SESSION, AD-05).
end note
@enduml
